<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Claude Code" version="24.0.0"><diagram name="1. Sơ đồ màn hình" id="756723"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;HỆ THỐNG QUẢN LÝ NHA KHOA NỤ CƯỜI VIỆT — SƠ ĐỒ MÀN HÌNH TỔNG QUAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;' color='#475569'&gt;Next.js (App Router, cổng 3000) → proxy /api → Node.js Express (cổng 4000) → PostgreSQL ClinicCybersoftDB · Mỗi thẻ: tên màn hình · route · mã use case · vai trò được dùng · nội dung chính&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Vai trò:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Lễ tân &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Bác sĩ &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Quản lý (kế thừa Lễ tân)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="10" width="440" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Chung&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#475569;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#475569;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="270" height="466" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Đăng nhập&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/login&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;UC-00&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#475569;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tất cả&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Tên đăng nhập, mật khẩu&lt;br&gt;• JWT cookie httpOnly 12h&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="120" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Tổng quan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#475569;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tất cả&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• 6 chỉ số trong ngày&lt;br&gt;• Lịch hẹn hôm nay (BS: lịch của mình)&lt;br&gt;• Nút nhanh: Đặt lịch, Tiếp đón&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="224" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Thông báo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/notifications&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-07&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#475569;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tất cả&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Cảnh báo vật tư dưới ngưỡng&lt;br&gt;• Đánh dấu đã xem&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="341" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Đổi mật khẩu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/account&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;UC-00&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#475569;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tất cả&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Mật khẩu cũ / mới / nhập lại&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="445" width="250" height="77" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;Bệnh nhân&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#2563eb;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="80" width="270" height="505" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Danh sách bệnh nhân&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/patients&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;BN-01&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Tìm theo SĐT / tên / mã&lt;br&gt;• 1 SĐT → nhiều bệnh nhân&lt;br&gt;• Nút Đăng ký mới, Số hóa hồ sơ&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="120" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Đăng ký / Số hóa hồ sơ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/patients/new&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;BN-02 · BN-03 · BN-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Kiểm tra trùng hồ sơ&lt;br&gt;• Người giám hộ khi &lt; 15 tuổi&lt;br&gt;• ?legacy=1: hồ sơ giấy cũ&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="237" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Hồ sơ bệnh nhân&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/patients/[id]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;BN-05 · BN-03 · BN-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Tab: Thông tin &amp; giám hộ, Lịch hẹn,&lt;br&gt;• Lịch sử điều trị, Liệu trình,&lt;br&gt;• Hóa đơn &amp; công nợ, Tài liệu (ảnh scan)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="354" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Sửa thông tin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/patients/[id]/edit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;BN-04&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Thông tin hành chính, tiền sử&lt;br&gt;• Trạng thái lưu trữ&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="471" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;Lịch hẹn &amp; tiếp đón&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#0284c7;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#f0f9ff;strokeColor=#0284c7;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="80" width="270" height="505" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Lịch &amp; khung trống&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/appointments&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;LH-01 · LH-03 · LH-04&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lưới giờ 30' × ghế, theo ngày&lt;br&gt;• Bác sĩ đang trực ca sáng/chiều&lt;br&gt;• Chi tiết lịch: check-in, đổi, hủy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="120" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Đặt lịch hẹn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/appointments/new&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;LH-02 · LH-07&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Chọn BN → dịch vụ → bác sĩ → ngày&lt;br&gt;• Khung trống trong ca + ghế trống&lt;br&gt;• BS dùng để hẹn tái khám&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="237" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Tiếp đón&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/reception&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;LH-08 · LH-09&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lịch hôm nay → Check-in (Đã đến)&lt;br&gt;• Khách vãng lai → tạo lịch tại chỗ&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="354" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Nhắc lịch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/reminders&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;LH-05 · LH-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lịch ngày mai + SĐT BN/giám hộ&lt;br&gt;• Ghi kết quả gọi&lt;br&gt;• Gửi SMS/Zalo khi không nghe máy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="458" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;Khám &amp; điều trị&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#0d9488;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#f0fdfa;strokeColor=#0d9488;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="80" width="270" height="661" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Hàng chờ khám&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/queue&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-01&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• BN đã check-in theo bác sĩ/ghế&lt;br&gt;• Bắt đầu khám → tạo phiếu&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="120" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Danh sách phiếu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/treatments&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-02 · TT-01&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lọc trạng thái, ngày, bác sĩ&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="224" width="250" height="77" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Phiếu điều trị&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/treatments/[id]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-02 · 03 · 04 · 06 · 08 · 09&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Dòng việc: dịch vụ + số răng FDI +&lt;br&gt;• bác sĩ thực hiện; đơn thuốc; vật tư&lt;br&gt;• Gắn buổi liệu trình; lịch sử sửa&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="315" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Danh sách liệu trình&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/plans&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-05 · BC-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Niềng / implant, tiến độ buổi&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="432" width="250" height="77" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Tạo liệu trình&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/plans/new&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-05&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Tổng giá trọn gói, số buổi&lt;br&gt;• Kế hoạch các đợt thanh toán&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="523" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Chi tiết liệu trình&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/plans/[id]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;DT-05&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Các buổi đã làm, đợt đã thu&lt;br&gt;• Kết thúc / hủy; lập HĐ liệu trình&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0d9488;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="627" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;Thanh toán&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#d97706;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="80" width="270" height="661" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Lập hóa đơn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/billing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;TT-01 · TT-02&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Phiếu 'Chờ thanh toán'&lt;br&gt;• Chụp giá hiện hành vào từng dòng&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="120" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Hóa đơn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/invoices&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;TT-04 · TT-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lọc trạng thái, tìm kiếm&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="224" width="250" height="77" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Chi tiết hóa đơn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/invoices/[id]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;TT-03 · TT-04 · TT-08&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Giảm giá (phân bổ theo dòng)&lt;br&gt;• Thu tiền nhiều lần, tiền mặt/CK&lt;br&gt;• Hủy hóa đơn (chỉ Quản lý)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="315" width="250" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;In hóa đơn / biên lai&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/invoices/[id]/print&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;TT-05&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Bản in A5/A4&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="432" width="250" height="77" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Công nợ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/debts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;TT-06&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nb