 color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;QT-01&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Lưới tuần: bác sĩ × ngày × ca&lt;br&gt;• Sao chép tuần trước&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="120" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Bảng giá&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/admin/prices&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;QT-02&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Giá mới theo ngày hiệu lực&lt;br&gt;• Không ghi đè giá cũ; lịch sử giá&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="224" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Danh mục&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/admin/catalog&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;QT-03&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Dịch vụ, ghế, vật tư &amp; thuốc,&lt;br&gt;• lý do hủy, định mức vật tư&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="328" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Kho vật tư &amp; thuốc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/admin/inventory&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;QT-04&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Tồn kho, nhập kho, kiểm kê,&lt;br&gt;• lịch sử phát sinh, ngưỡng tối thiểu&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="432" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Tài khoản &amp; phân quyền&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/admin/accounts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;QT-05&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• Nhân viên, đặt lại mật khẩu&lt;br&gt;• Ma trận quyền theo mã use case&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="536" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;b&gt;Báo cáo&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#be185d;fontColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#fdf2f8;strokeColor=#be185d;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="80" width="270" height="232" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;padding:2px 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Báo cáo (8 tab)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0f766e&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;/reports&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;BC-01 … BC-08&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#0d9488;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;BS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• BC-01 Doanh thu theo bác sĩ&lt;br&gt;• BC-02 Công suất ghế theo giờ&lt;br&gt;• BC-03 BN lâu chưa quay lại&lt;br&gt;• BC-04 Thống kê hủy lịch&lt;br&gt;• BC-05 Công nợ theo BN&lt;br&gt;• BC-06 Liệu trình đang dở&lt;br&gt;• BC-07 Vật tư sắp hết&lt;br&gt;• BC-08 Doanh thu theo tháng&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillC